# Windows "mark of the web" metadata that rides along with files copied from OneDrive
*:Zone.Identifier

# As-delivered archives of the HW evidence packages. The extracted trees are committed
# under hngac-package-from-farouq/ and hngac-package-v2-from-farouq/, so the zips would
# be byte-for-byte duplicates. v2 is a strict superset of v1; only its delta is tracked.
# See hngac-package-v2-from-farouq/PROVENANCE.md.
fpga/hngac-package-from-farouq.zip
fpga/hngac-package_v2.zip

# Repo mirrors inside the HW evidence package. These duplicate this working tree and
# invite editing the wrong copy. The reproducibility-critical parts are committed:
# kernel/5d/hngac-fpga/fpga/hls/ (exact source measured) and
# kernel/4d/hngac-fpga_4d_hw_results/ (earlier 4D Vivado place-and-route reports).
hngac-package-from-farouq/kernel/4d/*
!hngac-package-from-farouq/kernel/4d/hngac-fpga_4d_hw_results/
hngac-package-from-farouq/kernel/5d/hngac-fpga/*
!hngac-package-from-farouq/kernel/5d/hngac-fpga/fpga/
hngac-package-from-farouq/kernel/5d/hngac-fpga/fpga/*
!hngac-package-from-farouq/kernel/5d/hngac-fpga/fpga/hls/
hngac-package-from-farouq/**/*.backup

# Word lock files
~$*
